  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Green Agenda in Serbia: biodiversity and water for climate resilience - UNDP Grant Agreement EU for Green Agenda in Serbia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU:s Gr&#xF6;na Agenda i Serbien: biodiversitet, vatten och klimatresiliens</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to improve governance and management of ecosystems through increased capacities for planning, implementation and enforcement of nature, water and climate policies by 2026. 

The Project will support the EU environmental reform and efficient, inclusive and sustainable implementation the EU Green Agenda in Serbia. The Project will give focus to biodiversity, water and wetlands and climate resilience, by strengthening policy and base-conditions, supporting further work on Nature Based Solutions (NbS) through pilot projects and promote opportunities for mobilization and scale-up of climate and biodiversity financing. The Project aims at building capacity, cross-sectorial cooperation a societal dialogue as well as building strong partnerships between the public sector, private companies and civil society, to accelerate green transformation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudsyftet med projektet &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra styrning och f&#xF6;rvaltning av ekosystem genom &#xF6;kad kapacitet f&#xF6;r planering, genomf&#xF6;rande och uppr&#xE4;tth&#xE5;llande av natur-, vatten- och klimatpolitik i Serbien senast 2026.

Projektet kommer att st&#xF6;dja EU:s milj&#xF6;reform och ett effektivt, inkluderande och h&#xE5;llbart genomf&#xF6;rande av EU:s gr&#xF6;na agenda i Serbien. Projektet kommer att ge fokus till biologisk m&#xE5;ngfald, vatten och v&#xE5;tmarker och klimatmotst&#xE5;ndskraft, genom att st&#xE4;rka policy och basvillkor, st&#xF6;dja fortsatt arbete med Nature Based Solutions (NbS) genom pilotprojekt och fr&#xE4;mja m&#xF6;jligheter f&#xF6;r mobilisering och uppskalning av klimat- och biologisk m&#xE5;ngfaldsfinansiering. Projektet syftar till att bygga kapacitet, tv&#xE4;rsektoriellt samarbete och en samh&#xE4;llelig dialog samt bygga starka partnerskap mellan offentlig sektor, privata f&#xF6;retag och civilsamh&#xE4;llet, f&#xF6;r att p&#xE5;skynda en gr&#xF6;n omst&#xE4;llning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to improve governance and management of ecosystems through increased capacities for planning, implementation and enforcement of nature, water and climate policies in Serbia by 2026. 

The Project will support the EU environmental reform and efficient, inclusive and sustainable implementation the EU Green Agenda in Serbia. The Project will give focus to biodiversity, water and wetlands and climate resilience, by strengthening policy and base-conditions, supporting further work on Nature Based Solutions (NbS) through pilot projects and promote opportunities for mobilization and scale-up of climate and biodiversity financing. The Project aims at building capacity, cross-sectorial cooperation a societal dialogue as well as building strong partnerships between the public sector, private companies and civil society, to accelerate green transformation.</narrative>
  </description>
